<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The District Small Business Resource Guide | District Capital</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --navy: #0A1629;
            --navy-light: #162B45;
            --gold: #C5A059;
            --gold-hover: #D4AF37;
            --white: #FFFFFF;
            --off-white: #F4F7FA;
            --text-muted: #64748B;
            --border: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.2);
            --transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--off-white);
            color: var(--navy);
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .guide-container {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 60px auto;
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 80px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            position: relative;
            border-top: 8px solid var(--gold);
        }

        header {
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--off-white);
            padding-bottom: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .logo {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: block;
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            line-height: 1.2;
            color: var(--navy);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        h2 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: var(--navy-light);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        h2::after {
            content: "";
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--border);
            flex-grow: 1;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }

        h3 {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin: 20px 0 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        p {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .resource-card {
            background: var(--off-white);
            padding: 25px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .resource-card h4 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .compliance-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            background: var(--navy);
            color: var(--white);
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 60px;
            padding-top: 40px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .cta-box {
            background: var(--navy);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 40px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .cta-box h3 {
            color: var(--white);
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            background: var(--gold);
            color: var(--navy);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 20px;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: var(--white);
        }

        @media print {
            body { background: white; }
            .guide-container { box-shadow: none; margin: 0; width: 100%; max-width: 100%; padding: 40px; }
            .btn { display: none; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .guide-container { padding: 40px 20px; margin: 20px; }
            .compliance-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="guide-container">
        <header>
            <span class="logo">DISTRICT CAPITAL PARTNERS</span>
            <h1>The DC Small Business Resource Guide</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Grants, Tax Incentives & Compliance for District Operators</p>
        </header>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>01. Local Grant Opportunities</h2>
            <p>Unlike federal loans, these local District grants are designed specifically for businesses operating within the eight wards of DC.</p>
            
            <div class="resource-card">
                <span class="tag">DSLBD</span>
                <h4>Great Streets Retail Small Business Grant</h4>
                <p>Provides up to $50,000 for capital improvements and equipment for small businesses located in designated "Great Streets" corridors (e.g., H Street, Georgia Ave, Pennsylvania Ave).</p>
            </div>

            <div class="resource-card">
                <span class="tag">DMPED</span>
                <h4>Inclusive Innovation Equity Impact Fund</h4>
                <p>Dedicated to supporting District-based businesses that are at least 51% owned by economically disadvantaged individuals or individuals who have been subjected to racial or ethnic prejudice.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>02. District Tax Incentives</h2>
            <p>Leveraging local tax codes can significantly improve your cash flow and bottom line.</p>
            
            <h3>Qualified High Tech Company (QHTC)</h3>
            <p>Companies meeting QHTC criteria may be eligible for:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Reduction in corporate franchise tax rate to 0% for the first 5 years.</li>
                <li>Exemptions from personal property tax.</li>
                <li>New hire wage tax credits up to $5,000 per employee.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Work Opportunity Tax Credit (WOTC)</h3>
            <p>A federal credit available to DC employers for hiring individuals from certain target groups who have consistently faced significant barriers to employment.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>03. Essential Compliance Checklist</h2>
            <p>Navigating the DC Department of Licensing and Consumer Protection (DLCP) is critical for maintaining funding eligibility.</p>
            
            <div class="compliance-grid">
                <div class="resource-card">
                    <h4>Basic Business License (BBL)</h4>
                    <p>Required for all businesses in DC. Ensure your endorsement category matches your actual operations to avoid fines.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="resource-card">
                    <h4>"Clean Hands" Certification</h4>
                    <p>A mandatory requirement for any DC government grant or contract. Confirms you do not owe more than $100 to the District.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>04. Local Industry Resources</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Washington DC Economic Partnership (WDCEP):</strong> Site mapping and demographic data for new locations.</li>
                <li><strong>DC Main Streets:</strong> Ward-specific business support and neighborhood marketing.</li>
                <li><strong>SCORE DC:</strong> Free mentorship from retired executives familiar with the K-Street and Hill ecosystems.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <div class="cta-box">
            <h3>Need Capital to Match Your Grant?</h3>
            <p>Many DC grants require matching funds or "bridge" capital while waiting for reimbursement. District Capital provides fast-acting funding for DC operators who can't wait on government processing times.</p>
            <a href="#" class="btn">Apply for DC Funding</a>
        </div>

        <footer>
            <p>© 2024 District Capital Partners | 1200 G St NW, Washington, DC 20005</p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 10px;">This guide is for informational purposes only and does not constitute legal or financial advice.</p>
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>